{"id":"1e462022b17b959e","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree.md","title":"ZFC Recursion2 Path Through Tree","display":"df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree — ZFC Recursion2 Path Through Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree — ZFC Recursion2 Path Through Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-recursion2-path-through-tree — ZFC Recursion2 Path Through Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,x\\in V,\\quad T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad x\\in\\omega^\\omega\">\\(T,x\\in V,\\quad T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},\\quad x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PathThroughTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PathThroughTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}path\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PathThroughTree}_S(x,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}path\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PathThroughTree}_S(x,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate validates prefix closure of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> before asserting that every finite initial segment of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> lies in it.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,x\\in V,\\quad T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega},\\quad x\\in\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PathThroughTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}recursion2\\text{-}path\\text{-}through\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcRecursion2PathThroughTree}_S(x,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq\\omega^{<\\omega}\\land\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall n\\leq\\operatorname{lh}(s)\\;(s\\upharpoonright n\\in T)\\land x\\in\\omega^\\omega\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(x\\upharpoonright n\\in T)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false}],"bytes":984,"backlinks":[{"id":"8c53a40a7224e1b9","anchor":"ref-5","